# Filename : base_images.config
# Description:
#     The Labtainer base images fetched by setup_scripts/pull-all.py.
#     One image per line, named without the "labtainer." prefix or a registry.
#     An optional second field names the group the image belongs to; images in
#     the "metasploit" group are only pulled when pull-all.py is given -m.
#
base
network
firefox
wireshark
java
centos
lamp
netmon
tap
base2
network2
wireshark2
network.ssh2
metasploitable  metasploit
kali            metasploit
